      ],
      "seed": 1111,
      "text": "Three changes to a screen that otherwise stays put.\nchooseLevelButton() is written and uncalled, so it only has to\nbe called; Redeem badge code drops from primary to the text\nbutton; Get your code goes, its job now done at A4. The info\nbutton becomes Why SimpleX is built, exactly as the TODO in\nthe file says.",
