      "originalText": "Unchanged except where the price comes from: store.price()\nbecomes the catalog's monthPrice. The tiers stay app\nresources - BadgeLevel already holds the titles and the file\nsizes - so the catalog only prices them, and a level with no\nactive price is the disabled card this screen can already\ndraw.",
