      "seed": 1320,
      "text": "The screen keeps its shape - level name as the title, the\nprofile preview, the tagline, three cards - and loses its\npurpose: Pay $70 becomes Continue, and purchase() moves to\nA4. The cards here are the catalog's offers, 1 / 3 / 12\nprepaid months, rather than BadgePeriod's subscriptions -\nthe one real fork between this lane and the next.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 2,
