      "text": "The rows are the web page's summaryRows, which is where\nthis copy comes from. The total is the amount the reserved\ninvoice carries, never one the app worked out:\ncatalog_changed is not raised when only the amount moves,\nso a client pricing it locally would show a figure the service\nwill not charge.",
