      "text": "Reached by leaving A4, and by opening Support SimpleX with\na purchase already in flight - so it is state on BadgeState,\nnot a screen: one profile, surviving a restart, resolving with\nno browser at all. While it holds, neither Support SimpleX nor\nYour badge is the right thing to show, and the chat-list pitch\nbanner stays down.",
