      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Untouched, and reached without a code ever being generated,\nshown or typed - the point of the exercise. One thing does\nbreak: the Ends footer says prepaid months have no billing\ndate, which stops being true for a store subscription, so that\nsection needs a second wording before lane B can land.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4666666666666666
    },
