      ],
      "seed": 2420,
      "text": "Your level comes first and is the same screen as A2 with store\nprices, so it is not drawn twice. BadgePeriod as written today:\none-time, monthly, annual, six product ids, prices from\nStoreKit and Play in the storefront's currency. A store build\nnever sends getBadgeCatalog, so these need not match the\nweb page's and generally will not.",
