      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "No second button and no mention of paying elsewhere, in any\nstorefront - the browser lives on B2 now, not here, so this\nscreen is identical everywhere and nothing about it is gated.\nThat also removes the awkward part of the earlier draft: a\nsubscription had no web equivalent, and a code bought online\nis prepaid months, which the store path never has to reconcile.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2222222222222223
    },
