        "C1",
        "lane3"
      ],
      "seed": 3118,
      "text": "Settled: the app renders no payment method at all. TODO for\nthe service - getBadgeInvoice takes paymentVia today, and\nwhat it returns is method-specific (a Stripe client_secret, or\nan address and a crypto amount). It has to reserve the\ninvoice and its amount with no method chosen, and attach the\ndestination when the page picks one.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 2,
