      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It already resumes an order from the server, so an invoice the\napp reserved needs nothing new here. Card is not a hosted\npage - the invoice carries a Stripe client_secret and the page\nrenders Elements - which is the reason no card form can\nmove into the app, whatever else does.",
