      "groupIds": [
        "C3",
        "lane3"
      ],
      "seed": 3312,
      "text": "Only this lane reaches it. A settled invoice shows a code\ntoday - that is B3, and it stays - but an invoice the app\nreserved has none, so codeIssued would land on 'This code is\nnot on this device'. The button is a courtesy: the badge is\ngranted over SMP whether or not anyone comes back, so the\ndeep link may accelerate A5 and may never be its proof.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
