    {
      "id": "ft-head",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2830,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#1c1e26",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "footer"
      ],
      "seed": 4001,
      "text": "What this needs that does not exist yet",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a300",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790239746589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What this needs that does not exist yet",
      "lineHeight": 1.2941176470588236
    },
    {
      "id": "ft-svc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#4b5563",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "footer"
      ],
      "seed": 4002,
      "text": "The service, which today answers only redeemBadgeCode and issueBadge\n\n   getBadgeCatalog, whose first client would be the app\n   getBadgeInvoice, bound to a purchase key instead of a code hash, and\n      reserving the amount before a method is chosen - the page picks that\n   purchaseBadge funded by an invoice, answering payment_pending until the\n      webhook settles\n   Apple and Google receipt verification, for which no provider adapter exists",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a301",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790239746589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The service, which today answers only redeemBadgeCode and issueBadge\n\n   getBadgeCatalog, whose first client would be the app\n   getBadgeInvoice, bound to a purchase key instead of a code hash, and\n      reserving the amount before a method is chosen - the page picks that\n   purchaseBadge funded by an invoice, answering payment_pending until the\n      webhook settles\n   Apple and Google receipt verification, for which no provider adapter exists",
      "lineHeight": 1.3125
    },
    {
      "id": "ft-app",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#4b5563",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "footer"
      ],
      "seed": 4003,
      "text": "The app, which has the store layer already and no purchase API\n\n   APIGetBadgeCatalog, APIGetBadgeInvoice, APIPurchaseBadge\n   A4 and A5 as views, and the funded-not-yet-issued purchase on BadgeState,\n      kept in the invoices and payments tables the client schema already carries\n   B1's two labels and B2's Buy code online, both behind the same storefront check\n   finishing a store transaction only once the credential is stored, so that\n      Transaction.updates and queryPurchasesAsync redeliver it until it lands",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a302",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790239746589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The app, which has the store layer already and no purchase API\n\n   APIGetBadgeCatalog, APIGetBadgeInvoice, APIPurchaseBadge\n   A4 and A5 as views, and the funded-not-yet-issued purchase on BadgeState,\n      kept in the invoices and payments tables the client schema already carries\n   B1's two labels and B2's Buy code online, both behind the same storefront check\n   finishing a store transaction only once the credential is stored, so that\n      Transaction.updates and queryPurchasesAsync redeliver it until it lands",
      "lineHeight": 1.3125
    },
    {
      "id": "ft-web",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#4b5563",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "footer"
      ],
      "seed": 4004,
      "text": "The page, which needs the least\n\n   C3: a paid state for an invoice it did not create, and a link back to the app\n   an order started from a purchase key rather than a code hash\n   nothing for the store lane at all - B3 is the page exactly as it ships",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
