      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The page, which needs the least\n\n   C3: a paid state for an invoice it did not create, and a link back to the app\n   an order started from a purchase key rather than a code hash\n   nothing for the store lane at all - B3 is the page exactly as it ships",
      "lineHeight": 2.1
    },
    {
