      "groupIds": [
        "footer"
      ],
      "seed": 4005,
      "text": "Copy is quoted from the app and the page, so what reads wrong here reads wrong there too - except C3's 'Still processing', reworded off the page's 'This takes a block'. Non-store prices are the shipped catalog; store prices are illustrative.\nNot drawn yet: the refusals - no active price, a provider unavailable, too many attempts, and the catalog moving under the buyer - each of which the page already has a screen for.",
